l stands out for its versatility. Its design prioritizes the functionality of the spaces, offering a bedroom on the ground floor and a laundry area upstairs, making it one of the most comfortable options for families. Furthermore, its EDGE certification guarantees a sustainable home, with savings in water and electricity consumption and eco-efficient materials. Live in a smart home that has it all: functionality, technology, and environmental awareness.',3,2,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,2,0,2,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,1,'https://javer-api-dev-page.s3.us-east-2.amazonaws.com/javer-api-dev/images/media_1735577603768.png',NULL,NULL,'2026-03-19 16:48:16','2026-03-19 16:48:16',0,'','<iframe width=\'100%\' height=\'540\' src=\'https://my.matterport.com/show/?m=Zpv4NzksLec\' frameborder=\'0\' allowfullscreen allow=\'xr-spatial-tracking\' loading=\"lazy\"></iframe>','{}',0,NULL,0,'https://javer-api-dev-page.s3.us-east-2.amazonaws.com/javer-api-dev/images/media_1735577610217.png',NULL),(246,6,NULL,NULL,'Milán',NULL,'Modelo que te brinda el confort y tranquilidad en cada espacio diseñado para vivir en grande. Cuenta con un área asignado en planta baja para realizar una alcoba, un estudio o un centro de entretenimiento, espacio flexible a tus necesidades. Además, su certificación EDGE garantiza un hogar sustentable, con ahorros en agua, luz y materiales ecoeficientes. Descubre experiencias inolvidables en tu nuevo hogar inteligente.','A model that offers you comfort and tranquility in every space designed for a grand living experience. It features a designated area on the ground floor for a bedroom, study, or entertainment center, providing flexible space to suit your needs. Plus, its EDGE certification guarantees a sustainable home, with savings in water and electricity, and eco-efficient materials. Discover unforgettable experiences in your new smart home.',3,2,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,2,0,2,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,1,'https://javer-api-dev-page.s3.us-east-2.amazonaws.com/javer-api-dev/image-jpeg/1753896059834.jpg',NULL,NULL,'2026-03-19 16:48:16','2026-03-19 16:48:16',0,'','<iframe width=\'100%\' height=\'540\' src=\'https://my.matterport.com/show/?m=mvGgxirbtAm\' frameborder=\'0\' allowfullscreen allow=\'xr-spatial-tracking\' loading=\"lazy\"></iframe>','{}',0,NULL,0,'https://javer-api-dev-page.s3.us-east-2.amazonaws.com/javer-api-dev/image-jpeg/1753896070349.jpg',NULL),(248,40,NULL,NULL,'Atria',NULL,'Modelo pensado con todo lo que necesitas para la etapa de vida que estás viviendo. Sus características y espacios harán que vivas grandes momentos en familia.','Model designed with everything you need for the stage of life you are living. Its characteristics and spaces will make you live great family moments.',2,1,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,1,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,1,'https://javer-api-dev-page.s3.us-east-2.amazonaws.com/javer-api-dev/image-jpeg/1750358205166.jpg',NULL,NULL,'2026-03-20 00:21:06','2026-03-20 00:21:06',0,'','<iframe width=\'100%\' height=\'540\' src=\'https://my.matterport.com/show/?m=qxsiAYm47YG\' frameborder=\'0\' allowfullscreen allow=\'xr-spatial-tracking\' loading=\"lazy\"></iframe>','{}',0,NULL,0,'https://javer-api-dev-page.s3.us-east-2.amazonaws.com/javer-api-dev/image-jpeg/1750358216900.jpg',NULL),(252,37,NULL,NULL,'Milán',NULL,'El modelo Milán es un hogar acogedor, cómodo y funcional, diseñado en dos niveles con amplios espacios ideales para tu familia. Esta residencia inteligente cuenta con 3 habitaciones, 1 en la planta baja y 2 en la planta alta, además de dos baños y estacionamiento para dos autos. ¡No dejes pasar esta oportunidad única!','The Milán model is a cozy, comfortable and functional home, designed on two levels with ample spaces ideal for your family. This smart residence has 3 bedrooms, 1 on the ground floor and 2 upstairs, plus two bathrooms and parking for two cars. Do not miss this unique opportunity!',3,2,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,2,2,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NUL