s los días.','This apartment is designed for those who value tranquility, comfort, and quality of life. Spacious layouts designed to provide you with greater well-being.\nMore than a home, it\'s an investment in peace of mind: a haven where comfort and design come together to offer a serene lifestyle, ideal for resting, disconnecting, and living life to the fullest every day.',1,1,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,1,0,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,1,'https://javer-api-dev-page.s3.us-east-2.amazonaws.com/javer-api-dev/images/media_1720028394606.png',NULL,NULL,'2026-03-05 22:14:00','2026-03-05 22:14:00',0,'','<iframe width=\"100%\" height=\"485\" src=\"https://www.youtube.com/embed/GtGxcG6nc24?si=ymtq5OqKcwENvLHn\" title=\"YouTube video player\" frameborder=\"0\" allow=\"accelerometer; autoplay; clipboard-write; encrypted-media; gyroscope; picture-in-picture; web-share\" referrerpolicy=\"strict-origin-when-cross-origin\" allowfullscreen loading=\"lazy\"></iframe>','{}',0,NULL,0,'https://javer-api-dev-page.s3.us-east-2.amazonaws.com/javer-api-dev/images/media_1730330597911.png',NULL),(264,25,NULL,NULL,'Platino',NULL,'Excelente distribucion de espacios con techos altos en sala - comedor, perfecta para reuniones familiares. En el primer nivel con una recamara ideal para crear un estudio de trabajo. Esta residencia ofrece tecnologia inteligente que hara mas comodo y seguro tu dia a dia.','Excellent layout with high ceilings in the living and dining rooms, perfect for family gatherings. On the first level, there\'s a vaulted ceiling ideal for creating a work studio. This residence offers smart technology that will make your daily life more comfortable and safe.',4,3,1,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,2,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,1,'https://javer-api-dev-page.s3.us-east-2.amazonaws.com/javer-api-dev/image-jpeg/1757523523520.jpg',NULL,NULL,'2026-03-18 16:28:00','2026-03-18 16:28:00',0,'','<iframe width=\'100%\' height=\'540\' src=\'https://my.matterport.com/show/?m=GgKCY