just functionality: a home with character, balance, and a way of life to be enjoyed every day within the Real Valencia community.',2,1,1,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,1,0,0,NULL,1900000,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,1,'https://javer-api-dev-page.s3.us-east-2.amazonaws.com/javer-api-dev/image-webp/Casas-certificacion-edge-modelo-Valldemosa-javer_1770746624178.webp',NULL,NULL,'2026-03-19 16:03:29','2026-03-19 16:03:29',0,'','','{}',0,NULL,0,'https://javer-api-dev-page.s3.us-east-2.amazonaws.com/javer-api-dev/image-webp/Casas-certificacion-edge-modelo-Valldemosa-javer_1770746641419.webp',NULL),(317,7,NULL,NULL,'Myrtos',NULL,'Disfruta de amplios espacios y una excelente distribución en un lugar diseñado para tu comodidad. El modelo Myrtos es ideal para comenzar tu patrimonio y crear grandes momentos.','Enjoy spaciousness and an excellent layout in a place designed for your comfort. The Myrtos model is ideal for starting to build your wealth and creating great memories.',2,1,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,1,0,1,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,1,'https://api.derexqa.online/uploads/image-webp/zante-portada (1)_1775846821393.webp',NULL,NULL,'2026-03-19 16:35:49','2026-03-19 16:35:49',0,'','','{}',0,'{}',0,'https://api.derexqa.online/uploads/image-webp/zante-thumbnail_1775846826619.webp',NULL),(318,7,NULL,NULL,'Milán',NULL,'Hermosa casa contemporáneo con espacios diseñados para vivir cómodamente. Cuenta con 2 recámaras en planta alta y 1 recámara en planta baja además de tener dos baños completos para mayor comodidad, sin lugar a duda una excelente opción para vivir en armonía y con tranquilidad.','Beautiful contemporary home with spaces designed for comfortable living. It features two bedrooms upstairs and one bedroom downstairs, as well as two full bathrooms for added convenience—undoubtedly an excellent option for living in harmony and tranquility.',3,2,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,2,0,2,2,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,'https://javer-api-dev-page.s3.us-east-2.amazonaws.com/javer-api-dev/i