t and full bathroom, providing comfort and privacy.',3,2,1,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,2,0,3,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,1,'https://javer-api-dev-page.s3.us-east-2.amazonaws.com/javer-api-dev/image-webp/casa-muestra-Javer-Premier-vistas-del-nevado_1770676203724.webp',NULL,NULL,'2025-10-02 05:22:37','2025-10-02 05:22:37',0,'','<iframe width=\'100%\' height=\'585\' src=\'https://armada.com.mx/sitio/clientes/javer/toluca/vistas-del-nevado/javer-premier/360/\' frameborder=\'0\' allowfullscreen></iframe>','{}',0,NULL,0,'https://javer-api-dev-page.s3.us-east-2.amazonaws.com/javer-api-dev/image-webp/casa-muestra-Javer-Premier-vistas-del-nevado_1770676215973.webp',NULL),(340,30,NULL,NULL,'Águila Elite',NULL,'El Águila Elite aprovecha cada metro con un diseño versátil y confortable. Ofrece dos recámaras y una alcoba flexible para convertirse en estudio, sala de TV u oficina. Además, su recámara principal cuenta con una terraza privada, ideal para disfrutar de momentos al aire libre.','The Águila Elite makes the most of every square foot with a versatile and comfortable design. It offers two bedrooms and a flexible alcove that can be converted into a study, TV room, or office. The master bedroom also has a private terrace, ideal for enjoying time outdoors.',2,1,1,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,1,0,2,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,1,'https://javer-api-dev-page.s3.us-east-2.amazonaws.com/javer-api-dev/image-webp/casa-muestra-aguila-elite-vistas-del-nevado-javer_1770676250590.webp',NULL,NULL,'2025-10-02 05:22:37','2025-10-02 05:22:37',0,'','<iframe width=\'100%\' height=\'585\' src=\'https://armada.com.mx/sitio/clientes/javer/toluca/vistas-del-nevado/aguila-plus/360/\' frameborder=\'0\' allowfullscreen></iframe>','{}',0,NULL,0,'https://javer-api-dev-page.s3.us-east-2.amazonaws.com/javer-api-dev/image-webp/casa-muestra-aguila-elite-vistas-del-nevado-javer_1770676270016.webp',NULL),(341,32,NULL,NULL,'Águila',NULL,'Tu primer hogar con el espacio que tu familia necesita.\nCon dos pisos, amplias áreas y un baño y medio, el modelo Águila está diseñado para que vivas con comodidad y empieces a construir un futuro lleno de momentos felices.','Your first home with the space your family needs.\nWith two stories, spacious living areas, and one and a half bathrooms, the Águila model is designed for you to live comfortably and start building a future full of happy moments.',2,1,1,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,1,2,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,1,'https://javer-api-dev-page.s3.us-east-2.amazonaws.com/javer-api-dev/image-jpeg/1757605595074.jpg',NULL,NULL,'2025-04-01 03:33:03','2025-04-01 03:33:03',0,'','<iframe width=\'100%\' height=\'585\' src=\'https://armada.com.mx/sitio/clientes/javer/edo-mex/brisas-del-valle/aguila/360/\' frameborder=\'0\' allowfullscreen loading=\"lazy\"></iframe>','{}',0,NULL,0,'https://javer-api-dev-page.s3.us-east-2.amazonaws.com/javer-api-dev/image-jpeg/1757605153226.jpg',NULL),(342,32,NULL,NULL,'Antares',NULL,'El modelo Antares te ofrece el equilibrio perfecto entre confort y funcionalidad. La opción ideal para dar el primer paso hacia tu patrimonio y construir un futuro seguro.','The Antares model offers you the perfect balance between comfort and functionality. The ideal choice to take the first step towards your heritage and build a secure future.',2,1,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,1,1,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,1,'https://javer-api-dev-page.s3.us-east-2.amazonaws.com/javer-api-dev/image-jpeg/1757607970632.jpg',NULL,NULL,'2025-04-01 03:33:03','2025-04-01 03:33:03',0,'','<iframe width=\'100%\' height=\'585\' src=\'https://armada.com.mx/sitio/clientes/javer/edo-mex/brisas-del-valle/antares/360/\' frameborder=\'0\' allowfullscreen loading=\"lazy\"></iframe>','{}',0,NULL,0,'https://javer-api-dev-page.s3.us-east-2.amazonaws.com/javer-api-dev/image-jpeg/1757608006559.jpg',NULL),(343,31,NULL,NULL,'Águila Elite',NULL,'Tu nuevo hogar te espera en este elegante prototipo Águila Elite con dos habitaciones y una alcoba, ideal para aquellos que valoran el espacio extra y la funcionalidad para su hogar. Disfruta de la tranquilidad y las áreas recreativas de Valle de los Cedros.\n\nNuestras casas cuentan con certificación EDGE, lo que las convierte en un desarrollo a la vanguardia en materia de sostenibilidad, además de brindarte un ahorro del 30% en el consumo de energía eléctrica y agua\n\nNuestras casas cuentan con certificación EDGE, lo que las convierte en un desarrollo a la vanguardia en materia de sostenibilidad, además de brindarte un ahorro del 30% en el consumo de energía eléctrica y agua','Your new home awaits you in this elegant two-bedroom, one-bedroom Aguila Elite prototype, ideal for those who value extra space and functionality for their home. Enjoy the tranquility and recreational areas of Valle de los Cedros.',3,1,1,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,1,2,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,1,'https://javer-api-dev-page.s3.us-east-2.amazonaws.com/javer-api-dev/image-jpeg/1757549336200.jpg',NULL,NULL,'2024-08-05 21:59:43','2024-08-05 21:59:43',0,'','<iframe width=\'100%\' height=\'558\' src=\'https://armada.com.mx/sitio/clientes/javer/edo-mex/valle-de-los-cedros/aguila-elite/360/\' frameborder=\'0\' allowfullscreen allow=\'xr-spatial-tracking\' loading=\"lazy\"></iframe>','{}',0,NULL,0,'https://javer-api-dev-page.s3.us-east-2.amazonaws.com/javer-api-dev/image-jpeg/1765929165786.jpg',NULL),(344,31,NULL,NULL,'Águila Plus',NULL,'Conoce el prototipo Águila Plus, un espacio diseñado para brindarte la comodidad que necesitas y la felicidad que tú y tu familia merecen.\n\nAhora con un baño adicional, su diseño funcional, amplio y acogedor lo convierte en el lugar ideal para comenzar una nueva etapa en tu vida.','Discover the Águila Plus prototype, a space designed to provide you with the comfort you need and the happiness you and your family deserve.\nNow with an additional bathroom, its functional, spacious, and inviting design makes it the ideal place to begin a new phase in your life.',3,2,1,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,1,2,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,1,'https://javer-api-dev-page.s3.us-east-2.amazonaws.com/javer-api-dev/image-jpeg/1757551253438.jpg',NULL,NULL,'2024-08-05 21:59:43','2024-08-05 21:59:43',0,'','<iframe width=\'100%\' height=\'585\' src=\'https://armada.com.mx/sitio/clientes/javer/edo-mex/valle-de-los-cedros/aguila-plus/360/\' frameborder=\'0\' allowfullscreen loading=\"lazy\"></iframe>','{}',0,NULL,0,'https://javer-api-dev-page.s3.us-east-2.amazonaws.com/javer-api-dev/image-jpeg/1765929438865.jpg',NULL),(345,33,NULL,NULL,'Moretta V1',NULL,'Este prototipo ha sido diseñado cuidando cada detalle, pensando en el bienestar y la felicidad de tu familia.\nDisfruta de una casa equipada con cocina integral con barra de granito, alacena, bodega, dos baños completos con cancel de cristal templado, patio de servicio, gas estacionario y dos cajones de estacionamiento.','This prototype has been carefully designed with your family\'s well-being and happiness in mind.\nEnjoy a home equipped with a full kitchen with a granite counter, a pantry, a storage room, two full bathrooms with tempered glass partitions, a utility room, a gas station, and two parking spaces.',3,2,1,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,2,2,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,1,'https://javer-api-dev-page.s3.us-east-2.amazonaws.com/javer-api-dev/image-jpeg/1757610091407.jpg',NULL,NULL,'2024-07-30 05:20:18','2024-07-30 05:20:18',0,'','<iframe width=\'100%\' height=\'585\' src=\'https://armada.com.mx/sitio/clientes/javer/edo-mex/belporto/moreta/360/\' frameborder=\'0\' allowfullscreen loading=\"lazy\"></iframe>','{}',0,NULL,0,'https://javer-api-dev-page.s3.us-east-2.amazonaws.com/javer-api-dev/image-jpeg/1757609276227.jpg',NULL),(346,33,NULL,NULL,'Moretta V2',NULL,'Este prototipo ha sido diseñado cuidando cada detalle, pensando en el bienestar y la felicidad de tu familia.\nDisfruta de una casa equipada con cocina integral con barra de granito, alacena, bodega, dos baños completos con cancel de cristal templado, patio de servicio, gas estacionario y dos cajones de estacionamiento.','This prototype has been carefully designed with your family\'s well-being and happiness in mind.\nEnjoy a home equipped with a full kitchen with a granite counter, a pantry, a storage room, two full bathrooms with tempered glass partitions, a utility room, a gas station, and two parking spaces.',3,2,1,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,2,2,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,1,'https://javer-api-dev-page.s3.us-east-2.amazonaws.com/javer-api-dev/image-jpeg/1757611353424.jpg',NULL,NULL,'2024-07-30 05:20:18','2024-07-30 05:20:18',0,'','<iframe width=\'100%\' height=\'585\' src=\'https://armada.com.mx/sitio/clientes/javer/edo-mex/belporto/moreta/360/\' frameborder=\'0\' allowfullscreen loading=\"lazy\"></iframe>','{}',0,NULL,0,'https://javer-api-dev-page.s3.us-east-2.amazonaws.com/javer-api-dev/image-jpeg/1757609300723.jpg',NULL),(347,36,NULL,NULL,'Marsella',NULL,'Bienvenido a Marsella tu nuevo departamento a un precio irresistible. Disfruta de hermosos parques, canchas deportivas, áreas de juego y mucho más. Cuenta con 2 amplias habitaciones, 1 baño completo y 1 cochera para tu auto. ¡No dejes pasar esta increíble oportunidad de vivir en un entorno que lo tiene todo en Marsella!','Welcome to Marsella your new apartment at an irresistible price. Enjoy beautiful parks, sports courts, playgrounds and much more. With 2 spacious bedrooms, 1 full bathroom and 1 garage for your car, don\'t miss this incredible opportunity to live in an environment that has it all in Marsella!',2,1,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'https://my.matterport.com/show/?m=CqcDo1mFjqq',0,1,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,1,'https://javer-api-dev-page.s3.us-east-2.amazonaws.com/javer-api-dev/image-jpeg/1758125253579.jpg',NULL,NULL,'2024-01-01 05:35:18','2024-01-01 05:35:18',0,NULL,'<iframe width=\'100%\' height=\'585\' src=\'https://armada.com.mx/sitio/clientes/javer/jalisco/valle-de-tejeda/marsella/360/\' frameborder=\'0\' allowfullscreen loading=\"lazy\"></iframe>','{}',0,NULL,0,'https://javer-api-dev-page.s3.us-east-2.amazonaws.com/javer-api-dev/image-jpeg/1758124993226.jpg',NULL),(348,5,NULL,NULL,'Malva',NULL,'El modelo Malva es un hogar acogedor, cómodo y funcional, diseñado en dos niveles con amplios espacios ideales para tu familia. Trabaja en lo que te apasiona sin salir de casa, esta vivienda productiva, integra un espacio para comercio ¡No dejes pasar esta oportunidad única!','The Malva model is a welcoming, comfortable, and functional home, designed on two levels with spacious areas ideal for your family. Work on what you love without leaving home; this productive home includes a space for commercial use. Don\'t miss this unique opportunity!',3,1,1,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,1,2,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,1,'https://api.derexqa.online/uploads/image-webp/Praga-modelo-Malva-1200x800px copia_1775839569080.webp',NULL,NULL,'2026-03-31 17:12:05','2026-03-31 17:12:05',0,'','','{}',0,'{}',0,'https://api.derexqa.online/uploads/image-webp/Praga-modelo-Malva-800x600px_1775839578811.webp',NULL),(349,5,NULL,NULL,'Manet',NULL,'Es una vivienda funcional y accesible, diseñada para adaptarse a las necesidades de las familias de hoy. Ofrece espacios bien distribuidos que brindan comodidad y practicidad. Un hogar pensado para empezar una nueva etapa con confianza y tranquilidad.','It\'s a functional and affordable home, designed to adapt to the needs of today\'s families. It offers well-distributed spaces that provide comfort and practicality. A home designed to start a new chapter with confidence and peace of mind.',2,1,1,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,0,2,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,1,'https://api.derexqa.online/uploads/image-webp/principal-manete_1775600546657.webp',NULL,NULL,'2026-03-31 17:45:38','2026-03-31 17:45:38',0,'','','{}',0,'{}',0,'https://api.derexqa.online/uploads/image-webp/thumbnail-mannet_1775600464450.webp',NULL);
